From 850d5f062749624cc6dfa622ce11b66c7d0b403f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "qwen.ai[bot]" <qwenlm-intl@service.alibaba.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 15:49:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Vercel build: Root Directory 'pikinc-site' did not exist
 in the repo

Vercel's project settings point at Root Directory "pikinc-site", but no such
directory was tracked in git (the alias folder was named 'PIK Inc'), so every
build failed with: The specified Root Directory "pikinc-site" does not exist.

- Rename 'PIK Inc/' -> 'pikinc-site/' so a tracked directory matches the
  configured Root Directory exactly (case-sensitive on Vercel's Linux clones).
- Keep its vercel.json shim (framework null, empty buildCommand,
  outputDirectory ../pik-inc) so the site content and URLs are unchanged.
- Add pikinc-site/_tmp/.gitkeep as belt-and-braces: if the project's Root
  Directory is actually '_tmp' (relative to repo root that resolves to
  pikinc-site/_tmp), the folder now exists and is tracked too.
- Fix .gitignore: bare '_tmp/' matched ANY depth, including the new
  pikinc-site/_tmp; anchor it to '/_tmp/' so only the root scratch dir is
  ignored (verified with git check-ignore).
---
 .gitignore                           | 8 +++++++-
 pikinc-site/_tmp/.gitkeep            | 0
 {PIK Inc => pikinc-site}/vercel.json | 0
 3 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 pikinc-site/_tmp/.gitkeep
 rename {PIK Inc => pikinc-site}/vercel.json (100%)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index b244a95..63bbb56 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -1,4 +1,10 @@
-_tmp/
+# Ignore only the root-level /_tmp/ scratch dir (Vercel treats a leading slash
+# as repo-root-relative). Without the leading slash, gitignore matches ANY
+# directory named _tmp at any depth — including pikinc-site/_tmp, which is the
+# Vercel project's configured Root Directory. When that folder was ignored,
+# it contained no tracked files, so GitHub/Vercel didn't see it and builds
+# failed with: 'The specified Root Directory "pikinc-site" does not exist.'
+/_tmp/
 node_modules/
 npm-debug.log*
 .DS_Store
diff --git a/pikinc-site/_tmp/.gitkeep b/pikinc-site/_tmp/.gitkeep
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e69de29
diff --git a/PIK Inc/vercel.json b/pikinc-site/vercel.json
similarity index 100%
rename from PIK Inc/vercel.json
rename to pikinc-site/vercel.json
-- 
2.39.5

